'''SoL''': [[Silenced Meowing|Sub-chapter 34 - Silenced Meowing]]<br>'''ItF''': [[China (Into the Future)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - China Outbreak]]<br>'''CotC''': [[Eskimo Nebula (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Eskimo Nebula Outbreak]]
