==Enemy==
Zory is about as strong as [[Gory Dark]], has only 2 knockbacks, and is able to revive and burrow, but in exchange he only moves at the speed of a regular Gory. Unlike most other Zombie peons, he revives with 100% HP, and his burrow distance means he can quickly reappear exactly at backliners' position and instantly wreak havoc.

